window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Annika's tranquil Scottish vacation takes a cataclysmic turn when a mysterious book transports her to the realm of Tir Siroghlas. Stranded in this unfamiliar world, she awakens to a shocking truth: she's not who she thought she was.</p> <p>A handsome stranger, Damien, the gruff yet devastatingly handsome king of clan Tempestus, reveals that they share a deep, ancient bond and have known each other since birth. Their connection is undeniable, a spark that ignites with a simple touch, leaving them both yearning for more. However, Annika's memories are fragmented, leaving her hesitant and uncertain and Damien frustrated with the situation he's been presented with. As she slowly recovers her past through an ancient ritual to remove the binding her parents spelled her with, she discovers a world of magic, ancient clans, and a powerful destiny that has been waiting for her.</p> <p>As Annika and Damien navigate her re-discovery of her lineage, a sinister force lurks in the shadows, threatening to destroy everything they have come to know. To save the clan she never knew she had and her soul bond, she must learn to control her forgotten powers and embrace the life that was always hers.</p> <p>*Spicy Scenes</p> <p>*Cinnamon roll male main character</p> <p>*Strong female character, but the MMC still rescues her!</p> <p>*World building and character development</p> <p>*Banter and conversation between characters</p> <p>*Twists and turns abound in this series</p> <p>A book that will have you falling in love with Annika and Damien as she remembers. The love Damien has for her and the length he will go through to keep her safe will have you clutching the book with a sigh.</p> <p>Book 1 of The Soulbinding Chronicles</p>"; 
